~ statue_use

Unknown: Her hand is cold. Colder than stone has any right to be. [ID:CATH_STATUE_USE_1]
Unknown: Wait. I know this place. [ID:CATH_STATUE_USE_2]

=> END

~ statue_return

Unknown: Gold. Candles. Somebody loved this place. [ID:CATH_STATUE_RETURN_1]
Unknown: And somehow, I was there to see it. [ID:CATH_STATUE_RETURN_2]

=> END

~ statue_look

Unknown: A saint with her hand held out. Whatever she was offering, nobody took it. [ID:CATH_STATUE_LOOK_1]

=> END

~ altar_look

Unknown: An altar. Whatever was worshipped here has stopped answering. [ID:CATH_ALTAR_LOOK_1]

=> END

~ rose_window_look

Unknown: Most of the glass is gone, but the light still finds its way in. [ID:CATH_ROSE_WINDOW_LOOK_1]
Unknown: Stubborn. I like that in a window. [ID:CATH_ROSE_WINDOW_LOOK_2]

=> END
